WEBVTT

00:02:58.371 --> 00:03:02.079
Adjust your screen so it's at
or slightly below eyelevel.

00:03:02.121 --> 00:03:04.413
Make sure all parts of your body,

00:03:04.454 --> 00:03:07.079
such as your elbows
and wrists, are supported,

00:03:07.121 --> 00:03:10.246
using ergonomic aids if you need to.

00:03:10.288 --> 00:03:13.246
Try sleeping on your side
with your neck supported

00:03:13.288 --> 00:03:15.038
and with a pillow between your legs.

00:03:15.079 --> 00:03:18.746
Wear shoes with low heels
and good arch support,

00:03:18.788 --> 00:03:21.829
and use a headset for phone calls.

00:03:22.079 --> 00:03:25.538
It's also not enough
to just have good posture.

00:03:25.579 --> 00:03:29.621
Keeping your muscles and joints moving
is extremely important.

00:03:29.746 --> 00:03:33.163
In fact, being stationary for long
periods with good posture